# text = The old captain's prevailing indifference to his granddaughter's movements left her free as a bird to follow her own courses ; but it so happened that he did take upon himself the next morning to ask her why she had walked out so late she said , looking out of the window with that drowsy latency of manner which discovered so much force behind it whenever the trigger was pressed Here the conversation ceased , Eustacia's moral training never exceeding in severity a dialogue of this sort , which , if it ever became profitable to good works , would be a result not dear at the price .
