# text = But the lines of her mouth softened with thought , though not so far as they might have softened ; and she said She paused a few moments , and added Eustacia thought ; but she kept that in Thursday , the thirty-first of August , was one of a series of days during which snug houses were stifling , and when cool draughts were treats ; when cracks appeared in clayey gardens , and were called " earthquakes " by apprehensive children ; when loose spokes were discovered in the wheels of carts and carriages ; and when stinging insects haunted the air , the earth , and every drop of water that was to be found .
