# text = Thomasin was not in her room , and he found her in the front garden he began she remarked quickly , colouring as she met his gaze she went on , casting her eyes around and lowering her voice Yeobright promised , and she continued he said , altogether perplexed as to her drift she then observed blandly she said hastily Clym's face suddenly became grave she exclaimed almost petulantly Clym looked at the heath he answered at last said Clym , carefully concealing every clue to his own interrupted intention , which she plainly had not guessed said Clym Thomasin almost pouted now said Clym in a neutral tone sighed Thomasin she said sadly Her lips trembled , and she turned away to hide a tear .
